Preserved initial independent-audit failure (no model calls were made by the audit):

- UTC recorded: 2026-10-19T18:53:29+00:00
- Command: `python -m scripts.audit_m3_mechanism --run runs/m3/mechanism-20261020 --out docs/results/m3-mechanism`
